# Widget HTML/CSS/JS is NOT formatted by Prettier. iCUE's import parser and
# runtime are sensitive to exact HTML syntax: Prettier lowercases <!DOCTYPE html>
# and rewrites void tags as self-closing (<meta ... />), a form iCUE's importer
# fails to parse ("Missing title element"). Widget files must match the syntax of
# known-good widgets (uppercase DOCTYPE, non-self-closed void tags). Widget code
# is also excluded from ESLint for related reasons — see CLAUDE.md.
